WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.980
This is Sheprd: one window for your terminals and your coding agents.

2
00:00:05.985 --> 00:00:11.045
Each project gets a workspace in the sidebar, with real terminals in tabs.

3
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:16.440
Start an agent with the button next to the new tab button, and ask for a change.

4
00:00:16.443 --> 00:00:22.543
It works in the open: every file it reads, every edit, and every test it runs.

5
00:00:22.545 --> 00:00:26.885
When it's done, Review Changes shows exactly what changed.

6
00:00:27.455 --> 00:00:31.475
Read it line by line, and leave notes the agent picks up.

7
00:00:31.719 --> 00:00:37.659
And Command Shift P opens the palette: everything Sheprd does, one search away.

8
00:00:37.664 --> 00:00:42.084
That's the basics. Every feature has its own short guide below.
